# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research data.
#
# None of this belongs in the repository. Slides and banks are large, and a
# file committed once survives in the history even after it is deleted — so
# these patterns are deliberately broad. Tests generate their own synthetic
# slides at run time and never need real data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Whole-slide images
*.svs
*.ndpi
*.mrxs
*.scn
*.vms
*.vmu
*.bif
*.czi
*.tif
*.tiff

# Annotation sidecars and their migration backups
*.geojson
*.geojson.macos-mirrored.bak

# Predictions written beside a slide
*.predictions.json
*.predictions.json.gz

# Banks, saved states, projects, trained classifiers
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
bank.db
geometry_bank.json
*.pathlearn
*.pathlearn-project.json
*.cl
*.paninmodel.json

# Model weights. PathLearn ships NO weights: Phikon, UNI and UNI2-h each carry
# their own licence and none permit redistribution. Users convert their own.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
Extractors/
hf-cache/

# Exports
*.csv
*.xlsx

# Unpublished research notes: kept out of the repository deliberately.
PANIN-FEATURE-STUDY.md
